## Git and PR conventions

- Base branch: `main`
- Branch naming: `<type>/<ISSUE-KEY>-<short-description>` (e.g. `feat/PROJ-125-invoice-export`)
- Commit messages: <e.g., Conventional Commits>
- Keeping branches updated: <rebase | merge>
- PR title: `<ISSUE-KEY>: <short description>` (at most ~70 characters)
- PR template: <path, if any>
- **No AI attribution:** never add a `Co-Authored-By` trailer for Claude or any AI to commits, and never add "Generated with Claude Code" (or similar) lines or session links to commits or PRs.

